{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Үч курчум, бек дүйнө,", "text": "Үч курчум, бек дүйнө,", "en": "Three sharp trials, this hard world,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Кулачак кылып чалалы,", "text": "Кулачак кылып чалалы,", "en": "Let us swing and strike with full reach.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Жети курдук жан ошо,", "text": "Жети курдук жан ошо,", "en": "That soul endured seven circuits.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Тил алган балдар кагалы,", "text": "Тил алган балдар кагалы,", "en": "Let us summon the obedient boys.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Деп өжөктүп жети,", "text": "Деп өжөктүп жети,", "en": "So saying, seven rose in defiance.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Кайран тыш, жел жетпес,", "text": "Кайран тыш, жел жетпес,", "en": "Poor wanderer, beyond the wind’s reach,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Жетимек адам кайрады,", "text": "Жетимек адам кайрады,", "en": "The orphaned man sharpened his resolve.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Кыздарын сыр айттырып,", "text": "Кыздарын сыр айттырып,", "en": "They made his daughters reveal the secret.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Кылымдагыдай чын айтып,", "text": "Кылымдагыдай чын айтып,", "en": "Speaking truth as in the old age,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Кыйын аны сынга айтып,", "text": "Кыйын аны сынга айтып,", "en": "They spoke of that hardship as a trial.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Эки түрөй жерде,", "text": "Эки түрөй жерде,", "en": "In the place where two stood upright,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Алып Куман теңге,", "text": "Алып Куман теңге,", "en": "Brave Kuman stood his equal.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Айбатын түздү мындай Кенен,", "text": "Айбатын түздү мындай Кенен,", "en": "Thus Kenen set forth his terror.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Аны укканда эл жап,", "text": "Аны укканда эл жап,", "en": "When the people heard it, all gathered.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Дал-дал болду асыл баш,", "text": "Дал-дал болду асыл баш,", "en": "The noble head was torn to pieces.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Кабыландан жел жетпес,", "text": "Кабыландан жел жетпес,", "en": "The lion was beyond the wind’s reach.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Карамды кылган ага элек,", "text": "Карамды кылган ага элек,", "en": "We were the elder brothers who kept watch.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Каарданган келген эр элек,", "text": "Каарданган келген эр элек,", "en": "We were the angry heroes who arrived.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Агабыз колго кармап,", "text": "Агабыз колго кармап,", "en": "Our elder brother held it in his hand.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Чын өмүр сен элең,", "text": "Чын өмүр сен элең,", "en": "You were life itself.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Акыры тыш алабыз,", "text": "Акыры тыш алабыз,", "en": "At last we shall take the outside road.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Баатыр эрге кара элек,", "text": "Баатыр эрге кара элек,", "en": "We had not yet looked to the heroic man.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Убара эмне жер элек,", "text": "Убара эмне жер элек,", "en": "What land was free from trouble?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Энебиз айтып жети,", "text": "Энебиз айтып жети,", "en": "Our mother spoke and reached us.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Бу тактайдан кете элек,", "text": "Бу тактайдан кете элек,", "en": "He had not yet left this plank.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Тиленип жүрөр түшө элек,", "text": "Тиленип жүрөр түшө элек,", "en": "He had not fallen while walking in prayer.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Түйшүктү бала көрө элек,", "text": "Түйшүктү бала көрө элек,", "en": "The child had not yet known hardship.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Кабырга дене ката элек,", "text": "Кабырга дене ката элек,", "en": "Rib and body had not yet hardened.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Калың айыл чын билген,", "text": "Калың айыл чын билген,", "en": "The great village knew the truth.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Бул каарданда жата элек,", "text": "Бул каарданда жата элек,", "en": "He had not yet lain down in this wrath.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Башка айыл чала элек,", "text": "Башка айыл чала элек,", "en": "No other village had yet been struck.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Балалык кыны кала элек,", "text": "Балалык кыны кала элек,", "en": "The sheath of childhood had not remained.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Ай, кайгыга чалынуу,", "text": "Ай, кайгыга чалынуу,", "en": "Alas, to be overtaken by grief.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Эр Кенендин чырагы,", "text": "Эр Кенендин чырагы,", "en": "The light of hero Kenen,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l035", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 35, "raw": "Кызы тартты жан берген,", "text": "Кызы тартты жан берген,", "en": "His daughter endured it and gave her life.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l036", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 36, "raw": "Куса акса бал берген,", "text": "Куса акса бал берген,", "en": "Longing flowed, and she gave a child.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Completion-first provisional reading of difficult cursive; lexical form, proper name, or idiomatic interpretation requires later witness collation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf220:l037", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 220, "folio": 603, "line_in_page": 37, "raw": "Көзүнүн сен ачып.", "text": "Көзүнүн сен ачып.", "en": "You opened his eyes.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
